<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Friday, Dec 27 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Friday	 Dec 27   $64.45    dn 0.25</p>
<p>Thursday     Dec 26   $64.70    dn 0.42</p>
<p>Wednesday    Dec 25   $65.12    dn 0.47</p>
<p>Tuesday	Dec 24   $65.59    up 0.14</p>
</text>
